<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-21T11:30:01.958Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican military forces captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro in a dramatic operation that sparked gun battles and widespread violence across Sinaloa. Security forces engaged in firefights with cartel members, resulting in armed clashes that disrupted local events such as a baseball match and led to vehicles being set ablaze. The arrests and confrontations reflect an intensified crackdown on the Sinaloa cartel, which has been linked to recent migrant caravan movements toward the U.S. border. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/21/migrants-caravan-in-mexico-walks-towards-us-border?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNaTR4anpEVkluM0VyUnhEemgxdHk1MGp6bTdPLWtVMUZ1Nlh2MktQQzdwOGtWUmVzNkRHMC0tVS0wWk5Db2dEdGdJa3Z2cFQxdERkTW1RRHBPZU54X3dSaHNSZVJad2pvMXkwY3dPMDRfZU1WMFhyUDhpSE42THVhNzZYTTdpVzBscGlXbXNJNHhKOEo3SS1V?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOQVp5T1dTdUo4czdNRG5OS2RWZHZUNXJKeXdCaHA4VXRGT2FyNTdZOUd5ZlVEa05RQjdmZVE3UEg5X0FyLWRza1czYUdLS3ZXQmdVb041bGRkUHI1M2FXclZISnlWbTdldVhNeTFHZThwVFJUblRONHVuM0JWUzh5NDB3UnBPUVBBVGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOU0FWV1FKc3p4SlBzRVYzNFE3UEgyVXRtWWF6V0s0V29ieXJvOFdXcW9HcWxsUUs0SGhybHEwbWZvcEtCNzFDTTh6Z1lUTTh4SmRDSzlCeTlRLUw2cm1Db3VOU1M2eExORjhhTUxsbGM4V25GXzRIUVBadHV6RllDNlFISkpZTm9mRXpnTWRoNVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;cedarnews.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The News International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNYWk3T2dpYnBUU0JtSVA0RjV1WFRNTGRYc2JxSzRwT1hNdS1UWHBuTzBFU0twcEp2LTVPbDJObFhBT1FZUzRqe